We need to add a car rental feature to our booking app. The user should be able to select pickup and dropoff dates, choose a car class, and see the total price. I've sketched the API endpoints below.

```json
{
  "endpoints": [
    {"method": "GET", "path": "/cars", "description": "List available cars"},
    {"method": "POST", "path": "/rentals", "description": "Create a rental"}
  ]
}
```

Please implement the GET /cars endpoint first. Use the existing database schema in `models/car.py`. Make sure to handle date filtering. Also, add unit tests for the endpoint. Let me know if you need more details.
